        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>No Track No Tax Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill prohibits the use (directly or indirectly) of federal funds to study, propose, establish, implement, or enforce any state, local, or federal mileage tax, including through the funding of a mileage tracking program.</p>",
